# Environment Variables for HeirloomCorp Landing Page

# Secure submission endpoint for the Contact Us inquiry form (Section 08).
# Point this at a server-side relay that delivers to info@heirloomlegacy.org —
# e.g. a Formspree form URL, a serverless function, or a Make/Zapier webhook.
# The endpoint must hold any API keys / mail credentials itself; nothing secret
# belongs in this file or the frontend bundle.
#
# When left empty the form validates input but refuses to submit and tells the
# visitor to email directly. It never shows a false success message.
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=

# Canonical public production URL
VITE_SITE_URL=https://heirloomcorp.org
